		(descr "Arm 10-pin SWD, 2x5 1.27 mm: land for an SMD header (3220-10-0300-00) or a pogo-pin clip. Even pads run 0.3 to 3.15 mm off center, odd pads 0.3 to 2.6 mm, so pogo rows 1.27 or 2.54 mm apart land on them and, with the odd column along a board edge, a ground strip fits between those pads and the edge. No paste: hand soldered.")
